      "description": "A scene depicting two human legs covered in sand, positioned close together, suggesting a beach or seaside setting. The legs have visible tattoos, including a seashell tattoo on the right thigh, and are overlaid with humorous text about smelling the ocean. The spatial arrangement suggests a relaxed, beach-related context.",
