      "instance_name": "absurd_humor",
      "label": "Absurd Humor",
      "description": "The meme relies on absurd humor — making an illogical or impossible claim (tattoos can smell) to create amusement. This requires background knowledge about comedic techniques that use exaggeration and impossibility for effect.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
